    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41296" root="همت" body-key="h">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اهمت الكَلَامَ</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الضَّحِكَ</span>, <i>He made speech,
and laughter, low; he spoke, and laughed, low.</i>
(K.) It is said to be from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الهَمْسُ</span>; the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">س</span>
being changed into <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ت</span>. (MF.)

